          "summary": "Make the Deliverable licence perpetual/irrevocable and extend it to Affiliates, contractors and successors",
          "comment": "[Playbook] We cannot accept a Deliverable licence that Vendor may revoke at will and that ends with the Order Form term, so we have made it perpetual and irrevocable (subject to the existing Section 13.3 breach carve-out) and extended it to our Affiliates, contractors acting on our behalf, and a permitted successor. This aligns Section 14.2 with the licence terms already agreed in Sections 13.1-13.3; at a minimum we need Affiliate coverage and successor transferability.",
