              "oldText": "Customer receives a revocable, non-transferable licence to use a Deliverable only during the applicable Order Form term.",
              "newText": "Customer, its Affiliates, and contractors acting on their behalf receive a perpetual, irrevocable, worldwide, royalty-free, fully paid licence to use each Deliverable for their internal business purposes, transferable to an Affiliate or successor in connection with an assignment permitted by Section 24 and revocable or suspendable only as permitted by Section 13.3."
